Source: xbot
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: CruxOS XBot Maintainers <xbot@invalid.example>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, pkg-config, libgtk-3-dev, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: xbot
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus-user-session
Recommends: chromium
Description: CruxOS system fixer daemon and command line bridge
 XBot monitors and helps repair CruxOS system problems. This X0 package
 contains the service and status interface; detection is added in X1.

Package: xbot-helper
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: XBot privileged helper scaffold
 The helper is inactive in X0 and receives no privileged D-Bus activation.

Package: xbot-chat
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xbot (= ${binary:Version})
Description: XBot chat window
 A native window for XBot: its status, detected problems, a chat composer
 and settings. Chat replies arrive with the daemon's chat phase (X2); in X0
 the window shows status and edits settings.
